===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-sauver.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/so.ve/|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# to [[save]], [[rescue]]; to [[protect]]
# {{context|computing|lang=fr}} to save
# {{context|pronominal|lang=fr}} to [[escape]], [[run away]]

